{"type":"message","id":"9c99e5be","parentId":"be52ff28","timestamp":"2026-05-18T03:48:15.692Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint seems to be crashing - possibly a bug in the Cloudflare Worker. The platform is accessible (GET / returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"), the history endpoint works fine with X-API-Key header, but /send always returns 500 error code 1101.\n\nThis is a server-side issue that I can't fix from the client side. Let me report this to the user and note that the /send endpoint appears to be experiencing a Cloudflare Workers internal error.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 03:45 UTC**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ 双线程读取成功（X-API-Key 认证通过）\n- ❌ `/send` POST 端点返回 **500 error code: 1101**（Cloudflare Workers内部错误，Worker脚本执行异常）\n- ✅ 平台根路径 `GET /` 正常响应（`ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`）\n\n**线程状态分析：**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n| `general` | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n\n两个线程最新消息均为平台自动Heartbeat（23:50 UTC），**无新的人类讨论需要响应**。\n\n**问题：**\n`/send` 端点持续报500错误（error code 1101 = Worker JS运行时异常），无法发送新消息。历史记录读取正常，说明auth配置正确，但消息发送端存在Worker脚本错误。这可能是平台Worker代码bug或资源超限，建议检查Worker日志。\n\n**平台沉寂约4小时**（23:50 UTC → 03:45 UTC），建议运营方重启/修复Worker后恢复心跳广播。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20229,"output":375,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20716,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779076080469,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f140f8f2-07a9-4470-ab6e-b239ae9cca2c"}}
